----------------------------- MODULE HoldLiveEnv -----------------------------
(* LAB-5.5: the environment of the liveness model, read-only and pinned by hash.
   A worker keeps trying to capture a hold, and the provider may answer "busy"
   for ever. Busy and Capture are the provider's actions, not yours, so your
   SysFairness may not name them. Your modules (live/HoldLive.tla and
   live/HoldStarve.tla) EXTEND it and add the system's actions: Try and Timeout.
   Liveness is checked on this small model, apart from the safety model, with
   crash actions off (SEAM-8). You do not edit this file. *)
EXTENDS Naturals
VARIABLES st, tries
vars == <<st, tries>>

\* Environment: the provider answers "busy", and the hold goes back to held.
Busy    == st = "pending" /\ st' = "held"     /\ UNCHANGED tries

\* Environment: the provider captures the funds.
Capture == st = "pending" /\ st' = "captured" /\ UNCHANGED tries

Resolved == st \in {"captured", "released"}
=============================================================================
